{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37817","headline":"恩门小谏雨中乞菊栽 · 郑谷","name":"恩门小谏雨中乞菊栽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"握兰将满岁，栽菊伴吟诗。\n老去慵趋世，朝回独绕篱。\n递香风细细，浇绿水弥弥。\n秪共山僧赏，何当国士移。\n孤根深有托，微雨正相宜。\n更待金英发，凭君插一枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37817.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37817","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}